{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/20/7278423/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもう1か月以上前の写メか(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/20/7278423/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事やらレッスンやらありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n明日は個別だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/20/7278423/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVの予告編が公開されたけど、どういう展開になると思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/20/7278423/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季のドラマで面白かったのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8時30分開場です！\nいつもより早いよ～\n荷物検査があるので1部来てくださるかたはお早めに`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"荷物は一つにまとめて\nできるだけ少なめに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、金属も\n身につけない、持ってこない方が楽だと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はレーンの形もいつもと違って\n握手する前に荷物を全部置きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ厳重にはなって\nお手数おかけしますが\n握手会開催できるだけ良かったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり\nみなさんと直接お話できる場所って\n本当に大事だと思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと落ち込んでる時とかでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白かったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってもらえるだけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モチベ上がるし\nもっと頑張ろうって思える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、楽しみだな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるの待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/20/7278423/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}